cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If soar-lite does useful work in something you publish, cite it with this entry.
title: soar-lite
abstract: >-
  A JAX optimizer for objectives that are differentiable but expensive to
  evaluate. A flock of n paths descends in parallel with a unit-invariant
  diagonal secant preconditioner; a stalled path restarts from a Bayesian
  linear surrogate fit on projected coordinates; and the report keeps every
  served point, so an outside budget is spent against counted work.
authors:
